# Every stage directory is a Docker build context and every stage Dockerfile
# copies the whole of it into the image, so anything left lying about here gets
# baked in.  Nothing below is a file the stage needs: it is the debris that
# accumulates from running the suite locally, plus editor backups.  The same
# list ships in every stage directory in the benchmark -- a stage that
# excluded something the others kept would produce an image nobody could
# reproduce from the tree.  Stated without a count on purpose: the older copies
# of this file say "all twelve", which was true of four tasks and stopped being
# true when a fifth was added.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*~
*.orig
*.rej
.DS_Store
